{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiftNLP\/documentation\/SwiftNLP"]]},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"SwiftNLP"}],"roleHeading":"API Collection","title":"Dense Local Text Embeddings with Accelerate","role":"collectionGroup"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"topicSections":[{"title":"Embedding APIs","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftNLP\/documentation\/SwiftNLP\/LocalEmbeddingEngine"],"anchor":"Embedding-APIs"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Overview","level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Modern Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) and semantic search systems require dense vector representations of text. Traditional approaches depend on remote APIs (e.g. OpenAI) or large multi-gigabyte models that exhaust memory. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiftNLP"},{"type":"text","text":" introduces "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LocalEmbeddingEngine"},{"type":"text","text":", a subword N-gram character hashing projection engine that produces deterministic, unit-normalized dense embeddings in sub-millisecond execution times."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"1-Algorithmic-Foundation","level":2,"text":"1. Algorithmic Foundation","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LocalEmbeddingEngine"},{"type":"text","text":" operates through a three-stage mathematical pipeline:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Subword N-gram Hashing"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Text is tokenized into word and character n-grams (sizes 3 to 6). Each n-gram is hashed into a fixed integer space using FNV-1a hash functions."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Dimension Projection"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Hashes are projected onto a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"D"},{"type":"text","text":"-dimensional vector space (e.g., "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"D = 128"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"D = 256"},{"type":"text","text":") with deterministic sign flips to prevent feature collision bias."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Unit L2 Normalization"}]},{"type":"text","text":": The resulting dense vector is projected onto the unit hypersphere:"}]},{"name":"Note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Formula:","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"v_norm = v \/ ||v||_2 = v \/ sqrt(Σ v_i²)","type":"codeVoice"}]}],"type":"aside","style":"note"}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Because all embeddings have "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"||v||_2 = 1.0"},{"type":"text","text":", the "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Cosine Similarity","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" between two embeddings is equivalent to their direct "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Dot Product","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":", allowing single-instruction vector evaluation via Apple Accelerate "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vDSP_dotprD"},{"type":"text","text":":"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"name":"Note","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Formula:"}]},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CosineSimilarity(u, v) = u · v"}]}],"type":"aside"},{"anchor":"2-Generating-Embeddings","level":2,"text":"2. Generating Embeddings","type":"heading"},{"code":["import SwiftNLP","","\/\/ Initialize a 128-dimensional local embedding engine","let engine = LocalEmbeddingEngine(dimension: 128)","","\/\/ Generate embedding for a single text snippet","let vector = engine.embed(\"Apple Silicon M3 Max neural network processing\")","print(\"Vector dimension: \\(vector.count)\") \/\/ 128","","\/\/ Batch embedding generation","let documents = [","    \"High-performance computing on macOS\",","    \"Relational database wire protocol drivers\",","    \"Deep convolutional neural networks for vision\"","]","let batchEmbeddings = engine.embedBatch(documents)"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"anchor":"3-Integration-with-SwiftClusterVectorStore","level":2,"text":"3. Integration with SwiftCluster.VectorStore","type":"heading"},{"code":["import SwiftCluster","","let store = VectorStore(metric: .cosineSimilarity)","","for (idx, doc) in documents.enumerated() {","    let vec = engine.embed(doc)","    store.add(id: \"doc_\\(idx)\", vector: vec, metadata: [\"text\": doc])","}","","\/\/ Perform instant semantic similarity search","let query = engine.embed(\"Mac hardware acceleration\")","let topHits = store.search(query: query, topK: 1)","print(\"Top match: \\(topHits.first?.metadata[\"text\"] ?? \"\")\")"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swiftnlp\/denselocalembeddings"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Generate high-dimensional, unit-normalized semantic embeddings 100% offline on Apple Silicon.","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/SwiftNLP\/documentation\/SwiftNLP\/DenseLocalEmbeddings"},"kind":"article","references":{"doc://SwiftNLP/documentation/SwiftNLP/LocalEmbeddingEngine":{"url":"\/documentation\/swiftnlp\/localembeddingengine","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"LocalEmbeddingEngine"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"LocalEmbeddingEngine"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A lightweight, on-device dense text embedding generator optimized for Apple Silicon."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftNLP\/documentation\/SwiftNLP\/LocalEmbeddingEngine","title":"LocalEmbeddingEngine","role":"symbol"},"doc://SwiftNLP/documentation/SwiftNLP":{"url":"\/documentation\/swiftnlp","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Natural Language Processing, Text Feature Extraction & Native Apple NaturalLanguage Integration.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftNLP\/documentation\/SwiftNLP","title":"SwiftNLP","role":"collection"}}}